    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n36453" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐνώπ-ιος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			(<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὤψ</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>facing, to the front,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρό τ᾽ ἐνώπια</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Alc.
					<u>Supp.</u>
					4.17
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐνώπιος ἐνωπίῳ λαλεῖν</span>”
				<i>face to face,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					LXX
					<u>Ex.</u>
					33.11
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄρτοι ἐ.</span>
			<i>shew</i>bread, ib.<i><span class="en">
				25.29(30)
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διαστολῶν γεγονυιῶν ὑμῖν καὶ
				ἐνοπίοις</span> (sic) <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καὶ διὰ
				γραμμάτων</span>
			<i>in person</i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>UPZ</u>
				110.36
			</span></i><span class="entity">(ii B. C.)</span>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>Sammelb.</u>
				3925.6
			</span></i><span class="entity">(ii B. C.)</span>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> neut. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐνώπιον</span> as
				Adv., <i>face to face,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Theoc.
				22.152
			</span></i>; <i>in person,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				IG
				12(5).1061.10
			</span></i> (<span class="entity">Carthaea</span>), <i><span class="en">
				<u>PTeb.</u>
				14.13
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(ii B. C.)</span>: as Prep. c. gen., <i><span class="en">
				Aeschin.
				3.43
			</span></i> codd., <i><span class="en">
				<u>PCair.Zen.</u>
				73.14
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(iii B. C.)</span>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>PGrenf.</u>
				1.38.11
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(ii/i B. C.)</span>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Ep.Rom.</u>
				12.17
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Ep.Gal.</u>
				1.20
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hermog.
				<u>Inv.</u>
				1.1
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐ. θεῶν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>SIG</u>
					2843.7
				</span></i>
			 (Delph., <span class="entity">ii A. D.</span>). Regul. Adv.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ίως</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Suid.
				</span></i>
			</div>
